  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "round-heads-sahara-s055-p00600",
      "source_en": "Body paintings, scarifications and tattoos, are often associated with the boys' and girls' initiation rituals and the symbols on the human body are directed toward the spirits, to ask for protection and to enhance fertility (Goodman 1988). In this sense, the Round Head figures with body decoration may have represented individuals already initiated, and therefore individuals with a certain status in their society.",
